  "description": "Gong Hyun-Jae, who moved to a rural village, discovers that his father was an arsonist and becomes distraught. Then, there, he discovers a passageway connecting him to 15 years ago, where he encounters his mother and father from the past. Hyun-Jae begins to live with them and uncovers hidden secrets.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=844535), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13343472)\n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://manga.line.me/product/periodic?id=Z0004334)",
